<article class="acp-page" data-ac-page-section="public-about">
  <header class="acp-page-hero">
    <p class="ac-public-eyebrow">About ActiveClinic</p>
    <h1>Transforming clinic operations in Zambia</h1>
    <p class="ac-public-lede">ActiveClinic is a healthcare operations platform for clinics and hospitals. It is part of the GetPro product family, with a pilot focus on organisations in Zambia.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="acp-mission-grid" data-ac-about-section="mission">
    <article class="acp-mission-card">
      <h2>Our mission</h2>
      <p>Help clinical teams manage patients, appointments, and day-to-day workflows in a secure application — while giving participating clinics an honest public presence for patients.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="acp-mission-card">
      <h2>Zambia first</h2>
      <p>Phone formats, provinces, and timezone defaults are designed for Zambian healthcare organisations, with room to grow beyond the pilot.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="acp-mission-card">
      <h2>Clear boundaries</h2>
      <p>This public site lists only clinics that choose to publish. Staff clinical work happens after sign-in — not on marketing pages.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="ac-public-section acp-section" data-ac-about-section="platform">
    <header class="acp-section-header">
      <h2>The ActiveClinic platform</h2>
      <p>Multi-tenant clinic support with isolated organisation data and patient-facing booking requests where enabled.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="acp-feature-grid">
      <article class="acp-feature-card">
        <h3>Multi-tenant clinic support</h3>
        <p>Each organisation keeps its own patients, staff, and published website content.</p>
        <ul class="acp-check-list acp-check-list--compact">
          <li>Isolated tenant data</li>
          <li>Staff role management</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="acp-feature-card">
        <h3>Patient-centric access</h3>
        <p>Patients can discover clinics, submit booking requests, and look up request status with a secure link.</p>
        <ul class="acp-check-list acp-check-list--compact">
          <li>Directory discovery</li>
          <li>Reviewed booking requests</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="acp-feature-card">
        <h3>Uncompromising security posture</h3>
        <p>Clinical records stay in the authenticated application. Public pages never expose medical charts or results.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ac-public-section ac-public-section--alt" data-ac-about-section="capabilities">
    <h2>Capability status</h2>
    <p class="ac-public-note">We label features honestly. <strong>Available</strong> means live for enrolled organisations. <strong>Pilot</strong> means limited rollout. <strong>Planned</strong> means on the roadmap — not offered as a guarantee today.</p>
    <div class="ac-capability-grid">
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Clinic directory</h3>
        <p>Search published clinics by name, province, or city.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Staff operations app</h3>
        <p>Authenticated workspace for reception, appointments, and organisation administration.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Public tenant websites</h3>
        <p>Per-clinic pages for services, doctors, contact, and policies when published.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Appointment requests</h3>
        <p>Patients submit requests; clinics confirm — not instant booking guarantees.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--pilot">Pilot</span>
        <h3>Booking status lookup</h3>
        <p>Patients with a booking link can view status and request changes where enabled.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--pilot">Pilot</span>
        <h3>Patient portal</h3>
        <p>Clinic-scoped patient accounts for bookings and guest-booking linkage where enabled.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--planned">Planned</span>
        <h3>Automated notifications</h3>
        <p>SMS or email confirmations when delivery infrastructure is in place — not promised today.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--planned">Planned</span>
        <h3>Live slot calendars</h3>
        <p>Real-time availability requires clinic-configured schedules — not a platform-wide guarantee.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ac-public-section" data-ac-about-section="getpro">
    <h2>Part of GetPro</h2>
    <p>ActiveClinic shares platform foundations with other GetPro products while keeping its own clinical workflows, design system, and public website.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="acp-cta-band">
    <div class="acp-cta-band__inner">
      <h2>Questions about joining?</h2>
      <p class="ac-public-actions">
        <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--primary" href="/register-clinic">Register your clinic</a>
        <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--secondary" href="/solutions">View solutions</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
